  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6af5ca60547085228570b169",
      "text": "Allume",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493026,
      "updated": 1794493026
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca610000000000c852ad",
      "text": "✂ from [Muse]",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493026,
      "updated": 1794493026
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca610000000000c852af",
      "text": "[* Allume（旧Muse for Teams）]",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493026,
      "updated": 1794493026
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca610000000000c852b0",
      "text": "Scrapboxのようにガンガン[ボード切り出し]をやるようにしたらわかった感が出た[はるひ.icon]",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493026,
      "updated": 1794493026
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca610000000000c852b1",
      "text": "\t塊に名付けをするプロセスができる",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493026,
      "updated": 1794493026
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca610000000000c852b2",
      "text": " 制限を気にしてガンガン切り出せない(本末転倒)[基素.icon]",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493026,
      "updated": 1794493026
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca610000000000c852b3",
      "text": "  アイテムをリンクにしてボードを移動できるの面白い。瞬間移動",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493026,
      "updated": 1794493026
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca610000000000c852b4",
      "text": "  ここの使いようによって幅がだいぶ広がりそう[はるひ.icon]",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493026,
      "updated": 1794493026
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca610000000000c852b5",
      "text": "  手持ちにして移動する感じがゲームっぽくて楽しいかも",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493026,
      "updated": 1794493026
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca610000000000c852b6",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493026,
      "updated": 1794493026
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca610000000000c852b7",
      "text": "最近塊移動中にフリーズしてデータが一部消えてびっくりした[基素.icon]",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493026,
      "updated": 1794493026
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca610000000000c852b8",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493026,
      "updated": 1794493026
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca610000000000c852b9",
      "text": "[Muse for Teams https://museapp.com/]？",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493026,
      "updated": 1794493026
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca610000000000c852ba",
      "text": "\tそうです！",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493026,
      "updated": 1794493026
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca610000000000c852bb",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493026,
      "updated": 1794493026
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca610000000000c852bc",
      "text": "[Ink & Switch]がやっていたやつか[blu3mo.icon]",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493026,
      "updated": 1794493026
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca610000000000c852bd",
      "text": "\tInk & Switchだったのか[はるひ.icon]",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493026,
      "updated": 1794493026
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca610000000000c852be",
      "text": "\t\t知らなかった、完全に別経路から知った",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493026,
      "updated": 1794493026
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca610000000000c852bf",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493026,
      "updated": 1794493026
    },
